`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Proposed route, unimplemented and unexecuted."})," Pin engine/template/source and target identities; import a disposable copy from a fresh cache; validate scene, collision, materials and named animations; traverse a chosen platform, compare short/held jumps, collect one designated coin, shoot one enemy, then test respawn and fresh restart separately. Repeat the reachable, budgeted route in the exported artifact outside the editor, separately for each input modality. Check one coin increment plus label/visibility/audio feedback, animation-delayed enemy removal and retained state after respawn versus initial state after restart. Preserve import/export/runtime logs, dependency and artifact hashes, tick-indexed inputs/state, representative frames, audio and thresholds. Record accepted, quality failure, unsupported, infrastructure failure, timeout, cancelled or inconclusive separately. No deterministic replay, persistence or release-readiness claim follows from this proposed fixture."]}),`
